[ti:A Heart Full of Light]
[ar:for Shayan]

[00:02.00]there are people the world grows softer for holding
[00:09.00]and you have always been one of them
[00:16.00]you stayed gentle on the days that would have hardened anyone
[00:24.00]you stayed kind while your own body grew tired
[00:32.00]so if the night ever feels too long
[00:39.00]come back here, and remember
[00:46.00]you are loved beyond measure
[00:53.00]not for what you can carry
[01:00.00]but for the soul you simply are
[01:08.00]keep shining, gentle one
[01:16.00]the world is brighter for having you in it
